{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:04.36]Yeah\n[00:08.94]This one for all the people that believe in me\n[00:13.16]We gon' make it there\n[00:17.48]Juice, Juice\n[Chorus]\n[00:20.38]You still at the bottom\n[00:21.60]I’m still at the bottom, I'm not goin' anywhere\n[00:24.42]I’m chasin' the stardom, might happen tomorrow\n[00:26.96]Just hold on, I know we gon' make it there\n[00:29.24]We could look in the past and just drop it\n[00:31.14]But if you gon' keep it, I guess we could take it there\n[00:34.02]They say life is a game\n[00:35.24]Well, if that is the case, then I guess I'm just not gone be playing fair\n[00:39.60]You still at the bottom\n[00:40.82]I'm still at the bottom, I'm not goin' anywhere\n[00:43.80]I’m chasin’ the stardom, might happen tomorrow\n[00:46.18]Just hold on, I know we gon' make it there\n[00:48.48]We could look at the past and just drop it\n[00:50.42]But if you gon’ keep it, I guess we could take it there\n[00:53.22]They say life is a game\n[00:54.44]Well, if that is the case, then I guess I'm just not gone be playing fair\n[Verse 1]\n[00:58.96]Fuck everybody that hate me\n[01:00.58]Hold hands and jump off of that fucking cliff\n[01:02.90]I'ma start off by answering unanswered questions\n[01:05.44]The answer is no, you can't fuck with this (No, you can’t fuck with this)\n[01:08.62]But you don't have to\n[01:09.60]Let's cut to the chase, I'ma God of a rapper (A motherfuckin' God)\n[01:13.30]And when I say, \"Cut to the chase\"\n[01:14.92]I mean runoff and hope I don't stab you\n[01:17.06]Hope I don't have to fuckin' attack you\n[01:19.44]Spittin' more ink than a motherfuckin' tattoo\n[01:21.88]Bitch, I'm not bashful\n[01:23.10]Bitch, I will bash you\n[01:24.30]You just a sack to my tackle\n[01:26.12]I'm just a rapper with wrappings\n[01:27.88]Wrappin' this rap up in raps\n[01:29.28]So I guess I'm just wrappin' it up\n[01:31.44]Life is a drug so I trip like a Klutz\n[01:33.48]To the point where I'm really not giving a fuck\n[01:36.12]I think that I'm crazy\n[01:37.44]Fuck it, I know that I lost it\n[01:39.04]Ain't using my brain so I might as well toss it\n[01:41.74]If you don't like me, then jump in a coffin, I bet you're exhausted\n[01:45.26]Poke out your eyes so you can't see me flossin'\n[01:47.46]And cut off your tongue so I can't hear you talkin'\n[01:50.06]Cut off your ears so you can't hear me yappin'\n[01:52.32]I ain't mean to wake your ass up with my rappin'\n[Chorus]\n[01:56.38]You still at the bottom\n[01:57.56]I'm still at the bottom, I'm not goin' anywhere\n[02:00.60]I'm chasin' the stardom, might happen tomorrow\n[02:02.94]Just hold on, I know we gon' make it there\n[02:05.24]We could look at the past and just drop it\n[02:07.16]But if you gon' keep it, I guess we could take it there\n[02:10.00]They say life is a game\n[02:11.24]Well, if that is the case, then I guess I'm just not gone be playing fair\n[02:15.60]You still at the bottom\n[02:16.74]I'm still at the bottom, I'm not goin' anywhere\n[02:19.78]I'm chasin' the stardom, might happen tomorrow\n[02:22.18]Just hold on, I know we gon' make it there\n[02:24.46]We could look at the past and just drop it\n[02:26.42]But if you gon' keep it, I guess we could take it there\n[02:29.24]They say life is a game\n[02:30.44]Well, if that is the case, then I guess I'm just not gone be playing fair\n[Verse 2]\n[02:34.36]I'm up with the rockets\n[02:35.40]I'm so outta pocket\n[02:36.68]I take off, I'm out of this atmosphere\n[02:38.78]I'm so out of this world\n[02:40.06]I'm so out of my mind\n[02:41.24]I'm so out of my place\n[02:42.40]I'm so out of here\n[02:43.60]Please get out of my way before I go insane\n[02:46.00]And then put your ass out of your misery\n[02:48.46]All these niggas say that I'm so out of it\n[02:50.54]Well, I guess I don't know what's gotten into me\n[02:52.80]I'm just cruisin' and coolin', I vibe to survive and I hope you pick up on my energy\n[02:57.98]Catch his ass while he snoozin', that's straight homicide if you ever try takin' some shit to me\n[03:02.70]Swear the girl is the love of my life\n[03:04.58]Is it cheating if I say that life is a bitch to me?\n[03:07.60]Am I mean if I tell you to go straight to Hell, and that you niggas do not mean shit to me?\n[Chorus]\n[03:13.18]You still at the bottom\n[03:14.38]I'm still at the bottom, I'm not goin' anywhere\n[03:17.36]I'm chasin' the stardom, might happen tomorrow\n[03:19.74]Just hold on, I know we gon' make it there\n[03:22.06]We could look at the past and just drop it\n[03:23.98]But if you gon' keep it, I guess we could take it there\n[03:26.82]They say life is a game\n[03:28.02]Well, if that is the case, then I guess I'm just not gone be playing fair\n[03:32.40]You still at the bottom\n[03:33.54]I'm still at the bottom, I'm not goin' anywhere\n[03:36.62]I'm chasin' the stardom, might happen tomorrow\n[03:39.00]Just hold on, I know we gon' make it there\n[03:41.32]We could look at the past and just drop it\n[03:43.22]But if you gon' keep it, I guess we could take it there\n[03:46.06]They say life is a game\n[04:06.42]Well, if that is the case, then I guess I'm just not gone be playing fair\n[Outro]\n[04:25.94]Not gon' be playing fair\n[04:32.28]Not gon' be playing fair\n[04:34.96]Yeah\n[04:35.20]I'm just not gon' be playing fair\n[04:37.32]They say life is a game\n[04:40.06]Well, if that is the case, then I guess I'm just not gone be playing fair","words":[[4.36,4.64,"Yeah"],[8.94,9.08,"This"],[9.24,9.34,"one"],[9.38,9.42,"for"],[9.46,9.54,"all"],[9.62,9.68,"the"],[9.76,10.04,"people"],[10.08,10.16,"that"],[10.24,10.62,"believe"],[10.68,10.72,"in"],[10.8,10.86,"me"],[13.16,13.22,"We"],[13.3,13.44,"gon'"],[13.48,13.7,"make"],[13.74,13.76,"it"],[13.8,13.98,"there"],[17.48,18.78,"Juice,"],[18.88,19.14,"Juice"],[20.38,20.42,"You"],[20.52,20.76,"still"],[20.84,20.9,"at"],[20.96,21.02,"the"],[21.16,21.5,"bottom"],[21.6,21.64,"I’m"],[21.72,21.94,"still"],[22.02,22.08,"at"],[22.14,22.2,"the"],[22.34,22.7,"bottom,"],[22.76,22.84,"I'm"],[22.92,23.04,"